# A summon that also raises DEF for good, which is why every skill kind now has
# its levers read rather than only the passives -- GMS marks the permanent half
# "[Passive Effects: ...]" and hangs it off the active.
#
# 1.71 seconds is not on the wiki. It is the delay the Korean DPM calculator
# holds the summon at, beside the damage figure for level 10 exactly.
#
# The DEF it grants is dead by design, like every other percentage of DEF in
# the game -- see SkillEffect.def_pct.
name: "Phoenix"
skill_order: 3
description:
  "Summons a Phoenix that deals fire damage to nearby enemies on its own. "
  "Permanently increases DEF."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_RANGER
max_level: 10
max_enemies: 4
cast_interval_seconds: 1.71
base { skill_pct: 2.28 def_pct: 0.03 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.18 def_pct: 0.03 }
